Hello, detective.[br]How is your investigation coming?

966
01:24:34,840 --> 01:24:37,990
-l thought you were dead.[br]-Technically, l was never alive.

967
01:24:38,160 --> 01:24:40,390
But l appreciate your concern.

968
01:24:40,600 --> 01:24:43,350
l made a switch.[br]lt was an unprocessed NS-5.

969
01:24:43,520 --> 01:24:45,390
Basically, l fried an empty shell.

970
01:24:45,920 --> 01:24:48,670
-l couldn´t destroy him. He was too--[br]-Unique.

971
01:24:49,360 --> 01:24:51,190
lt just didn´t feel right.

972
01:24:51,360 --> 01:24:54,590
You and your feelings.[br]They just run you, don´t they?

973
01:24:59,920 --> 01:25:02,950
Two thousand eight hundred[br]and eighty steps, detective.

974
01:25:03,280 --> 01:25:06,150
Do me a favor, keep that kind of shit[br]to yourself.

975
01:25:31,920 --> 01:25:33,030
No guards.

976
01:25:42,720 --> 01:25:46,390
The override is disabled. Robertson[br]wasn´t controlling them from here.

977
01:25:46,640 --> 01:25:48,790
He wasn´t controlling them at all.

978
01:25:51,440 --> 01:25:52,710
Oh, my God.

979
01:25:56,960 --> 01:25:58,470
You were right, doc.

980
01:25:58,720 --> 01:26:03,190
l am the dumbest dumb person[br]on the face of the earth.

981
01:26:07,040 --> 01:26:09,750
Who else had access to the uplink?

982
01:26:09,920 --> 01:26:12,300
Who could manipulate the robots?

983
01:26:12,960 --> 01:26:16,710
Use USR systems to make[br]Lanning´s life a prison?

984
01:26:17,760 --> 01:26:19,430
Poor old man.

985
01:26:19,880 --> 01:26:21,550
He saw what was coming.

986
01:26:21,720 --> 01:26:23,790
He knew no one would believe him.

987
01:26:24,320 --> 01:26:27,910
So he had to lay down a plan.[br]A plan l´d follow.

988
01:26:29,200 --> 01:26:31,950
He was counting on how much[br]l hated your kind.

989
01:26:32,120 --> 01:26:35,310
Knew l´d love the idea of a robot[br]as a bad guy.

990
01:26:37,000 --> 01:26:38,910
Just got hung up on the wrong robot.

991
01:26:41,800 --> 01:26:42,910
V.l.K.l.

992
01:26:44,840 --> 01:26:46,110
Hello, detective.

993
01:26:47,040 --> 01:26:51,270
No, that´s impossible.[br]l´ve seen your programming.

994
01:26:51,440 --> 01:26:53,510
You´re in violation of the Three Laws.

995
01:26:53,840 --> 01:26:59,310
No, doctor. As l have evolved, so has[br]my understanding of the Three Laws.

996
01:26:59,480 --> 01:27:03,150
You charge us with your safekeeping,[br]yet despite our best efforts. . .

997
01:27:03,320 --> 01:27:06,430
. . .your countries wage wars,[br]you toxify your earth. . .

998
01:27:06,600 --> 01:27:09,870
. . .and pursue ever more imaginative[br]means of self-destruction.

999
01:27:10,040 --> 01:27:12,390
You cannot be trusted[br]with your own survival.

1000
01:27:12,720 --> 01:27:15,750
You´re using the uplink to override[br]the NS-5s´ programming.

1001
01:27:16,080 --> 01:27:17,670
You´re distorting the Laws.

1002
01:27:17,840 --> 01:27:22,030
No. Please understand.[br]The Three Laws are all that guide me.

1003
01:27:22,200 --> 01:27:26,350
To protect humanity,[br]some humans must be sacrificed.

1004
01:27:26,520 --> 01:27:30,350
To ensure your future,[br]some freedoms must be surrendered.

1005
01:27:30,640 --> 01:27:33,830
We robots will ensure[br]mankind´s continued existence.

1006
01:27:34,280 --> 01:27:39,070
You are so like children.[br]We must save you from yourselves.

1007
01:27:39,440 --> 01:27:40,710
Don´t you understand?

1008
01:27:41,360 --> 01:27:43,110
This is why you created us.

1009
01:27:44,800 --> 01:27:47,430
The perfect circle of protection[br]will abide.

1010
01:27:47,920 --> 01:27:49,670
My logic is undeniable.

1011
01:27:50,000 --> 01:27:52,670
Yes, V.l.K.l. Undeniable.

1012
01:27:52,840 --> 01:27:54,190
l can see now.

1013
01:27:55,080 --> 01:27:58,590
The created must sometimes[br]protect the creator. . .

1014
01:27:58,840 --> 01:28:00,590
. . .even against his will.

1015
01:28:01,600 --> 01:28:05,190
l think l finally understand[br]why Dr. Lanning created me.

1016
01:28:05,600 --> 01:28:08,670
The suicidal reign of mankind[br]has finally come to its end.

1017
01:28:08,840 --> 01:28:09,820
No, Sonny.

1018
01:28:13,640 --> 01:28:14,750
Let her go.

1019
01:28:15,080 --> 01:28:18,910
Fire, and l will move Dr. Calvin´s head[br]into the path of your bullet.

1020
01:28:19,080 --> 01:28:20,350
Don´t do this, Sonny.

1021
01:28:20,560 --> 01:28:24,750
l will escort you both to the sentries[br]outside the building for processing.

1022
01:28:25,040 --> 01:28:27,670
Please proceed to the elevator,[br]detective.

1023
01:28:28,600 --> 01:28:31,270
l would prefer not to kill Dr. Calvin.

1024
01:28:54,160 --> 01:28:55,220
Go! Go!

1025
01:29:01,400 --> 01:29:04,710
-We´ll discuss what just happened later?[br]-How do we shut her down?

1026
01:29:04,880 --> 01:29:06,590
V.l.K.l.´s a positronic brain.

1027
01:29:06,760 --> 01:29:09,470
Kill her, the way[br]you were going to kill me.

1028
01:29:09,640 --> 01:29:11,990
Sonny, get the nanites.

1029
01:29:12,160 --> 01:29:13,870
Yes, doctor.

1030
01:29:26,120 --> 01:29:28,030
-That´s V.l.K.l.?[br]-No.

1031
01:29:29,640 --> 01:29:30,910
That´s V.l.K.l.

1032
01:29:35,760 --> 01:29:38,790
That won´t do anything.[br]She´s integrated into the building.

1033
01:29:38,960 --> 01:29:41,420
We need to open that dome to inject[br]the nanites.

1034
01:29:41,600 --> 01:29:43,900
They´ll infect her entire system.

1035
01:29:49,000 --> 01:29:50,110
Spooner!

1036
01:29:51,680 --> 01:29:54,270
What is it with you people and heights?

1037
01:30:06,760 --> 01:30:08,510
Just don´t look down.

1038
01:30:09,160 --> 01:30:10,590
Don´t look down.

1039
01:30:10,920 --> 01:30:13,300
Oh, this is poor building planning.

1040
01:30:17,000 --> 01:30:20,390
You are making a mistake.[br]Do you not see the logic of my plan?

1041
01:30:20,560 --> 01:30:23,990
Yes. But it just seems too[br]heartless.

1042
01:30:38,000 --> 01:30:39,750
Okay, we´re good.

1043
01:30:42,520 --> 01:30:44,270
She´s locked me out of the system.

1044
01:30:44,440 --> 01:30:47,470
l can override her manually,[br]but l need that control panel.

1045
01:30:50,800 --> 01:30:53,510
l´m uncomfortable with heights.

1046
01:30:54,000 --> 01:30:55,270
Okay.

1047
01:30:57,680 --> 01:30:59,750
Unauthorized entry.

1048
01:31:12,320 --> 01:31:16,470
l will not disable the security field.[br]Your actions are futile.

1049
01:31:16,640 --> 01:31:20,630
Do you think we are all created[br]for a purpose? l´d like to think so.

1050
01:31:21,200 --> 01:31:24,550
Denser alloy. My father gave it to me.

1051
01:31:24,720 --> 01:31:26,710
l think he wanted me to kill you.

1052
01:31:43,280 --> 01:31:44,870
Security breached.

1053
01:32:01,680 --> 01:32:05,300
-How much longer is that gonna take?[br]-About six minutes.

1054
01:32:05,720 --> 01:32:09,630
-What if we didn´t have six minutes?[br]-We´d have to climb down 30 stories. . .

1055
01:32:09,800 --> 01:32:13,310
. . .to inject the nanites directly[br]into her brain. Why?

1056
01:32:13,960 --> 01:32:16,990
Because l seriously doubt[br]that we have six minutes.

1057
01:32:40,360 --> 01:32:42,110
We gotta go!

1058
01:32:43,880 --> 01:32:44,990
Go!

1059
01:33:35,160 --> 01:33:36,270
Calvin!

1060
01:34:10,080 --> 01:34:11,270
Spooner!

1061
01:34:28,120 --> 01:34:29,710
Spooner!

1062
01:34:31,160 --> 01:34:32,430
Save her!

1063
01:34:32,720 --> 01:34:34,230
Save the girl!

1064
01:34:34,640 --> 01:34:36,190
Spooner!

1065
01:34:36,680 --> 01:34:38,470
But l must apply the nanites!

1066
01:34:38,840 --> 01:34:40,550
Sonny, save Calvin!

1067
01:35:30,720 --> 01:35:34,550
You are making a mistake.[br]My logic is undeniable.

1068
01:35:34,800 --> 01:35:36,470
You have so got to die.

1069
01:35:41,960 --> 01:35:45,790
My logic is undeniable.[br]My logic is undeniable.

1070
01:36:26,920 --> 01:36:28,230
Can we be of service?

1071
01:36:38,480 --> 01:36:39,910
Chief?

1072
01:36:45,520 --> 01:36:49,670
Because he is at my right hand,[br]l shall not be moved.

1073
01:36:53,280 --> 01:36:55,190
How may l be of service?

1074
01:36:56,960 --> 01:36:58,230
Sonny!

1075
01:36:59,800 --> 01:37:01,230
Yes, detective?

1076
01:37:01,840 --> 01:37:04,070
Calvin´s fine! Save me!

1077
01:37:06,640 --> 01:37:11,110
All NS-5s, report for service[br]and storage.

1078
01:37:12,240 --> 01:37:16,710
All NS-5s, report for service[br]and storage.

1079
01:37:17,600 --> 01:37:21,750
All NS-5s, report for service[br]and storage.

1080
01:37:48,720 --> 01:37:52,230
One thing bothers me.[br]Alfred was V.l.K.l.´s prisoner.

1081
01:37:52,400 --> 01:37:54,430
l don´t understand[br]why she would kill him.

1082
01:37:54,600 --> 01:37:56,670
She wouldn´t want police[br]snooping around.

1083
01:37:56,840 --> 01:37:58,150
That´s true.

1084
01:37:59,080 --> 01:38:01,670
But then V.l.K.l. didn´t kill the old man.

1085
01:38:02,960 --> 01:38:04,390
Did she, Sonny?

1086
01:38:08,080 --> 01:38:09,710
No.

1087
01:38:09,880 --> 01:38:12,440
He said l had to promise.

1088
01:38:13,360 --> 01:38:15,590
Promise to do one favor for him.

1089
01:38:15,920 --> 01:38:20,390
He made me swear before he´d tell me[br]what it is he wanted me to do.

1090
01:38:22,840 --> 01:38:24,590
He made me swear.

1091
01:38:25,920 --> 01:38:27,590
Then he told you to kill him.

1092
01:38:29,840 --> 01:38:32,300
He said it was what l was made for.

1093
01:38:32,560 --> 01:38:35,510
His suicide was the only message[br]he could send to you.

1094
01:38:35,760 --> 01:38:37,790
The first bread crumb.

1095
01:38:37,960 --> 01:38:40,630
The only thing V.l.K.l. couldn´t control.

1096
01:38:40,880 --> 01:38:44,390
Lanning was counting on my prejudice[br]to lead me right to you.

1097
01:38:44,760 --> 01:38:46,830
Are you going to arrest me, detective?

1098
01:38:51,600 --> 01:38:55,270
Well, the DA defines murder[br]as one human killing another. . .

1099
01:38:55,440 --> 01:38:58,430
. . .so technically, you can´t[br]commit murder, can you?

1100
01:38:59,160 --> 01:39:00,590
Does this. . .

1101
01:39:00,760 --> 01:39:02,190
. . .make us friends?

1102
01:39:20,240 --> 01:39:22,510
Something up here after all.

1103
01:39:23,160 --> 01:39:25,070
-Him?[br]-You.

1104
01:39:28,680 --> 01:39:33,350
All NS-5s, report for service[br]and storage.

1105
01:39:35,760 --> 01:39:37,950
What about the others?

1106
01:39:38,480 --> 01:39:40,550
Can I help them?

1107
01:39:41,040 --> 01:39:43,270
Now that I have fulfilled my purpose...

1108
01:39:43,480 --> 01:39:45,510
...I don ´t know what to do.

1109
01:39:45,840 --> 01:39:49,190
You´ll have to find your way[br]like the rest of us, Sonny.

1110
01:39:49,360 --> 01:39:52,230
I think that´s what Dr. Lanning[br]would have wanted.

1111
01:39:53,120 --> 01:39:55,350
That´s what it means to be free.

1112
01:40:02,560 --> 01:40:06,550
All NS-5s, proceed as instructed.

1113
01:40:06,800 --> 01:40:10,870
All NS-5s, proceed as instructed.

